<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <title>서비스 접근 제한</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html, body {
      margin: 0;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 100%;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: #f5f6f8;
      font-family: Arial, "Noto Sans KR", "Apple SD Gothic Neo", sans-serif;
      color: #333;
    }

    .page {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 32px 20px;
    }

    .content-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 520px;
    }

    .logo {
      margin: 0 0 12px 4px;
    }

    .logo img {
      display: block;
      width: 170px;
      max-width: 45vw;
      height: auto;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 48px 34px 36px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    .icon {
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      font-size: 46px;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.45;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #222;
      word-break: keep-all;
    }

    .message {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.75;
      color: #666;
      word-break: keep-all;
    }

    .contact {
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid #e6e8eb;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #777;
      word-break: keep-all;
    }

    .contact .phone {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 5px;
      color: #222;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: 0.2px;
    }

    
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .page {
        padding: 22px 16px;
      }

      .logo {
        margin-bottom: 9px;
      }

      .logo img {
        width: 145px;
      }

      .container {
        padding: 40px 24px 32px;
      }

      .icon {
        font-size: 42px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 21px;
      }

      .message {
        font-size: 15px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .page {
        align-items: center;
        padding: 16px 14px;
      }

      .logo {
        margin: 0 0 8px 2px;
      }

      .logo img {
        width: 125px;
        max-width: 50vw;
      }

      .container {
        padding: 34px 20px 28px;
        border-radius: 10px;
      }

      .icon {
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        font-size: 38px;
      }

      h1 {
        margin-bottom: 14px;
        font-size: 19px;
      }

      .message {
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      .contact {
        margin-top: 24px;
        padding-top: 18px;
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .contact .phone {
        font-size: 17px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="page">
    <div class="content-wrap">

      <div class="logo">
        <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="IBK 연금보험">
      </div>

      <section class="container" aria-labelledby="access-title">
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">⚠️</div>

        <h1 id="access-title">서비스 접근이 제한되었습니다.</h1>

        <p class="message">
          보안정책에 따라 해외 IP에서의 서비스 접근이 제한됩니다.<br>
          국내 네트워크 환경에서 다시 접속해 주시기 바랍니다.
        </p>

        <div class="contact">
          서비스 이용 관련 문의는 콜센터로 연락해 주시기 바랍니다.<br>
          <span class="phone">콜센터 1577-4117</span>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
